      "id": "a15069212bf32113",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "## Level 5 — not built\n\nAlways-on autonomy, [[GBrain]]-style.\n\n**Deliberately skipped** — see [[0001-build-levels-1-4-skip-level-5|ADR-0001]] for the build-triggers that would change that.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2617a323c043224",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 980,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "## How to read this\n\nEach level answers one question: **L1** find it by exact name · **L2** pull a topic together · **L3** I searched different words than I wrote · **L4** trace a relationship chain.\n\nEvery box is a live note — click through. Full roadmap in [[Second Brain Levels]]; relationship vocabulary in [[Graph Schema]]."
    }
